# KOFC SaaS Blob — Client-Side Integration Guide

> **Function:** `GetSaasBlobUrl`  
> **Runtime:** .NET 8 (Isolated), Azure Functions v4  
> **Pattern:** Same as EApp / Policy Non-Header — MSAL SPA token → Boomi → Function  
> **Last updated:** 2026-08-19

[[_TOC_]]

---

## 1. Overview

Users open extracted files from the **Contact timeline** in Dynamics 365. The browser never calls the Azure Function directly. The path is:

```text
D365 timeline link
  → kofc_blob_open.html (web resource)
  → MSAL SPA token (scope: access_as_user)
  → Boomi REST (forwards same Bearer token)
  → GetSaasBlobUrl Function
  → { sasUrl } → browser opens file
```

**Key rules**

- Send **`path`** + **`contactId`** only — **no `userId`**
- User identity comes from the SPA token **`oid`** claim
- Boomi forwards the **same delegated token** to the Function (not client-credentials)
- Use **`format=json`** when calling Boomi from JavaScript

