## 4. Add a link to the Contact timeline

**Do not** put Boomi or Function URLs in timeline HTML. Link to the D365 blob opener with **business parameters only**.

### 4.1 URL shape (manual / test)

```text
{OrgUrl}/main.aspx?pagetype=webresource
  &webresourceName=kofc_blob_open.html
  &data={encodeURIComponent("path=" + encodeURIComponent(filePath) + "&contactId=" + contactGuid)}
```

**Alternative (pipe format)** — also supported by `kofc_blob_open.html`:

```text
{OrgUrl}/main.aspx?pagetype=webresource
  &webresourceName=kofc_blob_open.html
  &data={encodeURIComponent(filePath + "|" + contactGuid)}
```

**Example:**

```text
https://yourorg.crm.dynamics.com/main.aspx?pagetype=webresource&webresourceName=kofc_blob_open.html&data=D%3A%5CKOFCExt%20Extractions%5C09272024%5C000554%5Cfile.xlsx%7C12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012
```

- **`contactId`** = Contact GUID the timeline post is regarding (required for authorization)
- **`path`** = Windows-style path from extraction metadata, e.g. `D:\KOFCExt Extractions\...\file.xlsx`

### 4.2 Timeline HTML (ADF Copy activity)

Set pipeline global parameter:

- `D365_OrgUrl` = `https://yourorg-dev.crm.dynamics.com`

**Derived column for timeline `message`:**

```text
@concat(
  '<a href="',
  pipeline().globalParameters.D365_OrgUrl,
  '/main.aspx?pagetype=webresource&webresourceName=kofc_blob_open.html&data=',
  uriComponent(
    concat(
      'path=', uriComponent(item().filePath),
      '&contactId=', item().contactId
    )
  ),
  '" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View file</a>'
)
```

Replace `item().filePath` and `item().contactId` with your source column names.

**Plain-text label variant:**

```text
@concat(
  'File available: ',
  '<a href="',
  pipeline().globalParameters.D365_OrgUrl,
  '/main.aspx?pagetype=webresource&webresourceName=kofc_blob_open.html&data=',
  uriComponent(concat('path=', uriComponent(item().filePath), '&contactId=', item().contactId)),
  '" target="_blank">View file</a>'
)
```

### 4.3 JavaScript link builder (forms / plugins)

Publish `kofc_blobLinkBuilder.js` as a web resource, then:

```javascript
// Full opener URL (opens blob flow in new tab)
var url = KOFC.BlobLink.buildOpenerUrl({
    filePath: "D:\\KOFCExt Extractions\\09272024\\000554\\file.xlsx",
    contactId: "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012"
});
window.open(url, "_blank");

// Timeline post HTML (store in activity/message field)
var html = KOFC.BlobLink.buildTimelineMessageHtml({
    orgUrl: Xrm.Utility.getGlobalContext().getClientUrl(),
    filePath: "D:\\KOFCExt Extractions\\09272024\\000554\\file.xlsx",
    contactId: "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012",
    linkText: "View file"
});
```

