## 6. Programmatic open (in D365 form script)

```javascript
KOFC.Blob.configure({
    tenantId: "...",
    clientId: "...",
    apiAppId: "...",
    apiKey: "...",
    boomiUrl: "https://your-boomi-host/ws/rest/BlobProxy",
    scope: "access_as_user",
    httpMethod: "GET"
});

KOFC.Blob.openSaasBlob({
    path: "D:\\KOFCExt Extractions\\09272024\\000554\\file.xlsx",
    contactId: "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012"
});
```

On first visit, the user may be redirected to Microsoft sign-in; `kofc_authcallback.html` completes the Boomi call.

