## 8. Parameters reference

| Parameter | Required | Source | Notes |
|-----------|----------|--------|-------|
| `path` | Yes | Timeline / ADF | Windows path, e.g. `D:\KOFCExt Extractions\...` |
| `contactId` | Yes | Timeline regarding | Contact GUID, no braces |
| `format` | No | Client → Boomi | Use `json` for API response |
| `userId` | **No** | — | Ignored; identity from token `oid` |
| `oid` | **No** | — | Ignored; identity from token `oid` |

