## 9. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Check |
|---------|-------|
| Blank page / Xrm missing | Open via `main.aspx?pagetype=webresource`, not raw `/WebResources/` URL |
| 401 from Boomi | SPA token scope, Boomi JWT validation, API key |
| 403 from Function | Token missing `Blob.Read` or `access_as_user` scope |
| 403 contact access | User cannot read the `contactId` in Dataverse |
| 404 blob | Path must include `KOFCExt Extractions/` prefix as stored in storage |
| Sign-in loop | Redirect URI registered for SPA app; callback web resource published |

