## 10. Deployment checklist

### Function App (TEST-01 pipeline)

- [ ] Deploy `GetSaasBlobUrl` only (no local test function)
- [ ] Easy Auth enabled; audience = Function API app
- [ ] Managed Identity + Storage Blob Data Contributor
- [ ] Dataverse application user for MI
- [ ] App settings: `DataverseUrl`, `BlobContainerName`, `BlobStorageAccountName`

### Boomi

- [ ] REST process validates SPA JWT + `x-api-key`
- [ ] Forwards `Authorization: Bearer` unchanged to Function
- [ ] Does **not** use client-credentials to Function
- [ ] Does **not** send `userId`

### Dynamics 365

- [ ] Publish all web resources (§2)
- [ ] Set environment variables (§3)
- [ ] ADF timeline copy uses opener URL (§4.2)
- [ ] Test one timeline link end-to-end

